window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Iris stands on the precipice of her legacy as a Phoenix, her powers flickering to life like embers in the dark. But the shadows still stir, threatening to snuff out the fragile spark of her potential.</p> <p>Thalia finds herself ensnared in the tangled threads of her family's ambitions. Her fate is not her own, but a pawn in the game of alliances and dominance. The pressure mounts as Thalia's parents scramble to secure a marriage alliance that will fortify their Clan's standing.</p> <p>The stakes rise as Adrian and Iris navigate the uncharted territory of their fated connection. Bound by destiny, they must grapple with the complexities of love while racing against time to thwart the imminent threat posed by Evelyn, Isaac, and the Court of Shadows.</p> <p>Will they unlock the secrets that bind them and forge a path towards salvation, or will the darkness consume them all?</p>"; 
